'Behind-the-scenes group was the Islamic movement in East Turkestan," he added, with his remarks being picked up by the New China Agency.
The Chinese police have identified the driver of the vehicle whose name suggests that he is of Uyghour origin and clarified that his wife and mother were with him in the car.
