It could have been seriously injured or worse.
Ruby was taken to the vengeary for control; his general condition was satisfactory, apart from exhaustion and dehydration.
Miss Hall, from Halifax in West Yorkshire, said, “I was terrified looking at relief.”
I didn't first believe she was up there.
