"Undoubtedly between EUR 120-150 million in any country", he said last March.
His Burmese cat on his lap, in the lounge of his huge apartment in a building on Avenue Foch just a few steps from the Arc de Triomphe, the malicious eye under his white-haired, he cited a few of the languages in which the adventures of SAS were translated: Italian, German, Russian, Greek, Japanese or Korean.
